<title>UK: London gold closes weaker, white metals follow.</title>
<headline>London gold closes weaker, white metals follow.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Ends at $318.30/$318.80 versus $324.25/324.75 after overnight losses. Bounced off lows just under $314.00. Some support at $315.00.</p>
<p>SILVER - Closes 10 cents weaker at $4.44/$4.46 with gold. Support at $4.30.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Closes at $410.50/$414.50, down $8.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ends weaker at $181.70/$185.70.</p>
</text>
